    dialog: Of course, captain.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=futura>Monika tries wait for a good moment to strike. Not that
